    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A scale is a lexical coordinate system, not a key signature. `in scale`" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// changes only what `step` means for the music it encloses; it emits no key" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// fact and claims no modulation. *Lexical* is the whole of it: a step is" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// finished where it is written, so the same three notes written under two" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// collections are two passages, and a phrase saved in a binding is already" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// finished and no later `in scale` reaches back into it." },
    { "kind": "piece", "text": "piece" },
    { "kind": "string", "text": "\"Scale Context\"" },
